cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Wenn du den Katalog nutzt, zitiere ihn bitte so. Zitiere außerdem die Quelle jedes eingesetzten Konstrukts. / If you use the catalogue, please cite it like this. Also cite the source of each construct you use."
title: "askurious-constructs: Katalog von Skalen und Standardfragen für Askurious"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  The open catalogue of the constructs of Askurious: scales and standard questions with their metadata, sources,
  licences and structure, and the wording where its licence allows passing it on. Releases are signed and named
  YYYY.MM.N (CHANGELOG.md).
